# Local-only recovery artifacts — not for publication.
# RECOVERY.md names the old Pages deployment (its access gate was client-side
# only); deployed-site/ is a snapshot of that build. Both are kept on disk but
# out of the public repo. Delete these two lines to publish them.
/RECOVERY.md
/deployed-site/
